    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Debug the Gap: Carlos's Recipe Page\r\n\r\nCarlos wrote this vision:\r\n\r\n> *\"I want a recipe page for my grandmother's arroz con leche. It's a traditional Mexican rice pudding dessert. The page should have the recipe name at the top, a list of ingredients, and a list of steps to make it.\"*\r\n\r\nAnd here's his reaction:\r\n\r\n*\"I just wanted one simple recipe page and now there's a bunch of recipes I didn't even ask for. I don't even know where my actual recipe went. It's way too much.\"*\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. **Diagnose:** Carlos asked for one thing and got three. What might have made AI add extras?\r\n2. **Fix it by talking to AI Tutor.** Sometimes the most important instruction is what **not** to do: \"only the arroz con leche recipe - remove everything else, and don't add anything I didn't ask for.\"\r\n3. **Judge the result** against Carlos's vision before accepting.\r\n\r\nWhen the page shows exactly one recipe - his grandmother's - click **Continue**.",
