    "offer_browser_tts": "true",
    "teacher_markdown": "**Intent:** The over-generation failure mode - AI \"helpfully\" added content nobody asked for. The skill: negative constraints. Telling AI what to leave out is as much a part of clear communication as telling it what to include.\r\n\r\n**Circulation questions:**\r\n\r\n- \"Why do you think AI added recipes Carlos didn't ask for?\"\r\n- \"What did you tell AI *not* to do?\"\r\n\r\n**Expected mistakes and misconceptions:**\r\n\r\n- Students may delete-by-listing (\"remove churros, remove tamales...\") - works, but ask what happens if AI adds something else next time; the durable fix is \"nothing I didn't ask for\"\r\n- Students may lose the original recipe in the cleanup - remind them to check Carlos's actual content survived\r\n",
    "require_edit_to_continue": "true"
  },
